        "claim": "test:create-install editor-ai passes for base-nova and radix-luma shadcn projects built from the local registry and rebuilt dists, including a slash Heading 2 completion among the installed editor commands."
      }
    ],
    "limits": "Run logs are local and git-ignored; a matching hash establishes spec identity, not a run. IME proof is synthetic Chromium CDP composition only: physical desktop and mobile IME, Android taps during composition, WebKit's confirming Enter on a real IME and any emulated Android or WebKit proof of the settle mechanism are missing. The native owner has not reviewed the public settleInput or its fallback, which refuses instead of flushing when Plite resolves no single runtime. Autocomplete inside owned content roots is not built. Same-root panes, outside clicks, a live Copilot model beside Mention, a browser slash-guard refusal, a concurrent footnote ref, an element read-only refusal, screen-reader navigation and migration of named roots and inputs with meaningful children have no case. isAnotherEditorFocused reads data-editor attributes until Plite reports which Editable holds a shared selection. No cost proof ran; the key-to-paint contract waits on Benchmark. pnpm check did not run because the tree holds other sessions' changes and its schema-adoption step fails at HEAD. Playwright WebKit is not Safari. Interrogate used three same-family Opus reviewers and one Codex review of the pre-fix diff; the later fixes and the closing trail review are same-family only."
